WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[Very quiet background sound. No speech.]
[Inside the library at Isunzu Yacu: shelves full of books line the walls.]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
[Many children sit and stand together between the bookshelves.]

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[Children and adults move through the room. Tables and desks line the far end.]

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
[The camera turns toward the tables and desks at the far end of the room.]
